description:
«Sort Master: Adventure Time» is a relaxing and fun anti-stress puzzle game that develops mental skills and relieves stress by providing mini-games from sorting to arranging school items with obstacles.

Game Features:
🎯 Variety of mini-games for each level;
🎨 Attractive graphics;
🍀 Relaxation and stress relief;
🎮 Smooth and convenient game mechanics;
🧠 Development of creative abilities.

"Blackriver Mystery. Hidden Objects" is a new game in which you have to try on the role of a mystical detective, the one who is destined to restore the town from the ruins and solve its mystery. Here you will find a lot of interesting quests, unique collections, popular mini-games (such as three-in-a-row, wheel of fortune and others).

It's time to solve the riddle of Black River, detective!

Main features of the game:
- the need to rebuild the city from the ruins;
- search for items in the most beautiful locations;
- an intriguing plot;
- monsters;
- fascinating puzzles and mini-games;
- ominous anomalies;
- search for items like a real detective;

Explore locations, find the most difficult items following an interesting plot. Play three-in-a-row and use boosters. The fate of the whole city is in your hands!

Good luck, Detective.

Draw Bridge: Puzzle Challenge - solve puzzles, draw bridges, connect paths and test your logic with stickman in a fun game with creativity!

Game Features:
🎮 Simple and addictive gameplay;
🎯 Ragdoll physics;
🎨 Creative freedom;
🧩 Diverse levels;
🚀 Accuracy Challenges.

Can your designs stand up to the pressure and lead to victory? Let's paint!

Art Master Puzzle: Coloring Book is a new coloring game where you need to restore a picture from parts!

Start assembling the picture - initially the picture will be black and white. Look carefully at the pieces of the picture that will be displayed at the bottom of the screen and match them with the parts of the picture. Make a picture in full color and liven it up!

- Unique pictures to color and collect;
- An excellent combination of two genres - puzzles and coloring books;
- Bright and colorful color game graphics
- Free hints

Ragdoll Brainrot Meme: Walk Challenge! is a casual puzzle game with ragdoll physics, long legs, meme characters, a walking challenge, and crash scenes!

Game Features:
🕺 Long-legs challenge;
🧠 Meme brainrot chaos;
🕹️ Easy controls;
🏆 Levels of varying difficulty;
💥 Ragdoll physics;

Want to test your nerves, logic, and balance? Get ready — here, every step might be your last!
